20	// for a version that is not losslessly representable text: the JSON input
21	// holds a raw invalid UTF-8 byte, which a lenient reader would silently
22	// rewrite to "�" and merge into another version. The whole batch is refused
23	// with a non-zero exit, no success counts on stdout, an error naming the
